2019-38</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Aneurysm from RCA</td><td>anévrisme ou occlusion d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-43</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Occlusion from LAD</td><td>anévrisme ou occlusion d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-44</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Occlusion from LCA main</td><td>anévrisme ou occlusion d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-45</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Occlusion from LCX</td><td>anévrisme ou occlusion d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-46</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Occlusion from RCA</td><td>anévrisme ou occlusion d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0092</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Origine anormale de l'artère coronaire à partir de l'arbre artériel pulmonaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG159</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Anomalous pulmonary origin (includes ALCAPA)</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-33</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, ALCAPA</td><td>ALCAPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-34</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, ARCAPA</td><td>ARCAPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0093</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Origine aortique anormale ou trajet anormal de l'artère coronaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG158</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Anomalous aortic origin of coronary artery from aorta (AAOCA)</td><td>origine aortique anormale seulement, pas le trajet</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-32</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Abnormal origin other</td><td>« autre origine anormale »</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0094</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Fistule artérielle coronaire congénitale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG160</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Fistula</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-39</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Fistula from LAD</td><td>fistule d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-40</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Fistula from LCA main</td><td>fistule d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-41</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Fistula from LCX</td><td>fistule d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-42</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Coronary artery anomaly, Fistula from RCA</td><td>fistule d'une artère précise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0095</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Malformation congénitale du péricarde</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG073</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pericardial disease, Other</td><td>maladie péricardique « autre », congénitale ou acquise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0096</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Anomalie congénitale du septum auriculaire</td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0097</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Foramen ovale perméable</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG001</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">PFO</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0098</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Communication interauriculaire dans la fosse ovale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG002</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">ASD, Secundum</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0099</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Anomalie du sinus veineux</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG003</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">ASD, Sinus venosus</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0100</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Communication interauriculaire par l'orifice du sinus coronaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG004</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">ASD, Coronary sinus</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0101</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Anomalie congénitale de l'oreillette droite</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-30</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Diverticulum, Atrium, Right</td><td>diverticule seulement</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0102</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Anomalie congénitale de l'oreillette gauche</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG-2019-29</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Diverticulum, Atrium, Left</td><td>diverticule seulement</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0103</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Oreillette gauche divisée</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG024</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Cor triatriatum</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0104</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Sténose ou hypoplasie congénitale centrale des artères pulmonaires (en amont de la bifurcation hilaire)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG043</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary artery stenosis, Branch, Central (within the hilar bifurcation)</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0105</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Sténose ou hypoplasie congénitale périphérique des artères pulmonaires (au niveau ou en aval de la bifurcation hilaire)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG044</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary artery stenosis, Branch, Peripheral (at or beyond the hilar bifurcation)</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0106</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Artères pulmonaires droite et gauche congénitalement discontinues, non confluentes</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG165</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary artery, Discontinuous</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0107</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Artère(s) collatérale(s) systémico-pulmonaire(s) majeure(s) (MAPCA)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG035</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">MAPCA(s) (major aortopulmonary collateral[s]) (without PA-VSD)</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0108</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fistule (malformation) artérioveineuse pulmonaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG127</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary AV fistula</td><td>ECHSA ne distingue pas congénital et acquis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0109</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Bloc atrioventriculaire complet congénital idiopathique</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DIAG111</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Arrhythmia, Heart block, Congenital</td><td>le concept TAUSSIG est idiopathique</td></tr></table></div>"
  ] ;
